{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "name": "Regal",
  "theme": "regal",
  "_about": "After a 1987 Buick Regal's dash (generated by tools/gen_regal.py, edit that): chrome-framed side pods, the left a 12 V voltmeter (8..16 V) and the right oil temperature (50 / 110 / 150 C), each needle pivoting from the pod's inner edge, with the BRAKE lamp and CRUISE under them; the centre panel holds a swinging speed needle over a straight row of mph numbers, 5 to 85 with 55 amber at the middle (as the Turbo 3.8's), the the speed big in the VFD orange over the 55, P R N D and the gear number under it (the needle, a layer of its own, sweeps over them), the range and the clock in the pods where the turn signals were, the fuel needle centred between a yellow LED boost bar (0..1.5 bar) and the LED rev bar (yellow from the shift point); Miku sitting on the ledge over the boost bar, swinging her legs (your own bake, tools/live2d_bake pose sit). No map window. Shader rdash plus text sheets.",
